  "preview": "Separate session previewRoomState. No spend/equip until explicit confirmation. Four tiles per page, six exact catalogue definitions.",
  "purchase": "One serialized atomic profile write. Stable action ID prevents duplicate spending. Purchase ledger stores inverse snapshot and guard. Retry can reconstruct the same one-use undo token.",
  "undo": "Cancel preview first. Otherwise reverse only the last purchase from the active visit, once. Concurrent balance/ownership/equipment changes refuse the inverse. Normal exit and a new purchase expire older undo eligibility.",
  "owned_and_free_play": "Owned confirmation equips without spend-ledger debit. FreePlay writes its separate temporary equipment layer and never earned ownership or wallet. Coin counter hidden in FreePlay.",
  "projection": "Confirmed room cosmetics appear behind workshop controls; selected cushions carry into Scene09 and shared squish previews. FreePlay equipment is ignored when FreePlay is off.",
  "shared_squish": "In-scene 512-triangle live solver with up to two contacts, press/drag/stretch, reset and keyboard squeeze. Uses current recipe and seed. Never writes photo, recipe, wallet or rewards. Native Scenes05/09 controls retained. Preview controls available on creation, mixture, reveal, photo, shelf, gift, discovery and decorated workshop views. The revealed toy now also opens its live preview directly after landing. Quiet play retains intentional squish input; generated guidance remains available when sound is muted.",
  "reveal": "146 registered Scene08 cells:48 shape-specific peel frames,48 landing frames,6 canonical heroes,4 Pip poses, and40 guide/sheen cells. Includes new generated press/stretch hand guidance alongside bottom-release and next arrows.",
  "storyboard_reference": [
    "reference_storyboards/board_3.jpg",
    "reference_storyboards/board_4.jpg"
  ],
