  "limitations": [
    "Connected browser access was unavailable. DOM/canvas fixtures validate state and drawing commands, not actual browser raster appearance. Browser, download/file-picker and physical-tablet QA remain outstanding.",
    "2D generated frames, live textured-mesh deformation and runtime compositing, not a production3D rig or recorded video pipeline. Native generated PNGs remain unmodified.",
    "Some source cells use opaque vignettes, confined to portraits or catalogue tiles. Transparent install/reward sprites are used for in-room objects. UI panels have opaque CSS backgrounds for readable runtime controls.",
    "Whole-profile localStorage with rollback backups and Web Locks when available. Browser quota varies. Without Web Locks, cross-tab editing is not fully exclusive. Failed writes keep prior data and publish no tentative purchase/reward.",
    "Only UK English text is installed. Optional shape speech depends on an available browser voice. Soft procedural music/effects are placeholders for final mastered audio.",
    "Compact backups omit photos and invalidate temporary captures, while preserving recipes, parked drafts and progress. Full backups include local photos but must fit10MiB to import.",
    "The local symbol gate prevents accidental access; it is not authentication, consent verification or a purchase authorisation system."
  ],
